Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.89,0:01:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kembali lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ke medan perang sialan ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.93,0:02:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku enggak bertarung di garis depan\Nseperti Mebuki dan yang lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku hanya bertarung saat bisa menang
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan mengincar sedikit keuntungan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertarungan demi mencari\Nuang makan malam hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.29,0:02:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurutku, mata uang yang cocok\Nsaat ini adalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:40.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena bukan Yen, orang Jepang\Nkurang terbiasa, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.63,0:02:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}volume perdagangannya tertinggi di dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergerakannya terbilang\Ncukup mudah ditebak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uang yang aku miliki cuma cukup...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.40,0:02:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}untuk 1 lot minimum saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.64,0:02:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena uangku terlalu sedikit,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:57.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}1 lot pun terhitung\Nleverage tinggi, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalau aku beli di harga murah ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}pasti...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.12,0:03:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku bisa makan malam pakai tempura-don!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.81,0:03:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Posisi beli.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tembak 1 lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantulan ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.31,0:03:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pasti bisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kayaknya bisa tambah dessert juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mungkin tembus 1,35\Ndengan mudah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, EUR/USD tembus 1,35?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.61,0:03:41.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Turunnya drastis sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mau bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah pasang posisi jual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:51.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi memang, posisi jual itu\Nsepertinya masuk akal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.55,0:04:00.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga coba-coba menjualnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:03.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong,\Nkamu jual berapa lot, Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.52,0:04:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}40 lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.22,0:04:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti leverage-nya sekitar 20 kali, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leverage tinggi seperti biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, leverage 20 kali itu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tergolong rendah, sih.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia ini dungu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya! Mantul di situ, bodoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.62,0:04:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bangsat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu beneran mau nyuruh aku puasa, ya?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.33,0:04:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Turun lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:41.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau bagaimana lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.41,0:04:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pelindung jari!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cukup! Sampai sini aja!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Batas turunnya cuma sampai di sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.15,0:04:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya aku udah pasang pelindung!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan gitu, tolol!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:07.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa sih pencipta Forex\Nyang cuma bikin stres ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cut loss! Cut loss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat aja!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.49,0:05:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pasti rebut kembali!\NDalam satu taruhan ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}All-in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.84,0:05:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Balik posisi jual!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.23,0:05:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Loh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.81,0:05:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sama seperti sebelumnya,\Napa di sini titik terendahnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ujungnya turun juga, sialan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki! Ayo pergi belanja!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh iya, dia bilang mau\Npulang kampung saat liburan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:42.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi menang sampai\N430 ribu yen di EUR/USD?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:45.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Coba kamu kasih tahu aku juga...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sendiri yang bilang\Nmau berlomba.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, ayo kita aliansi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.64,0:06:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aliansi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.89,0:06:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aliansi untuk menyusul Kak Mochiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, boleh aja...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:07:00.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi memang keren!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:03.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langsung ke intinya,\Nbagaimana Pound hari ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.82,0:07:05.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pound, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.83,0:07:08.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini mending tunggu dan lihat dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:09.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu dan lihat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.27,0:07:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan posisi beli?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.91,0:07:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal rasanya sebentar lagi akan naik!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, aku pantau dulu aja.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.63,0:07:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal kelihatannya mau naik...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya ampun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:28.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bantu siapkan makanan juga, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.01,0:07:30.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira kalau tinggal sendiri\Nkamu bakal jadi lebih baik,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}nyatanya malah makin enggak karuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.85,0:07:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu membersihkan kamar\Ndengan benar, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:37.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak bisa dipercaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:42.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paling kamu menghamburkan\Nuang beasiswamu juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:43.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.11,0:07:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ini pintar sekali menabung, tahu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.87,0:07:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tabunganku malah makin menumpuk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti kamu bisa bayar\Nuang kuliah tahun keempat, dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.95,0:07:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu masih dibahas lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sendiri yang bilang mau bayar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:07:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.85,0:08:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cukup deh bahasnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.45,0:08:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanannya jadi enggak enak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.84,0:08:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.41,0:08:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya sudahlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:12.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biayai saja uang kuliahnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin di masa depan\Ndia bisa jadi akademisi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begini terus sih enggak mungkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.29,0:08:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurutku, kakak enggak akan sanggup.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau sudah begini,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.84,0:08:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku akan raup untung besar
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sampai uang kuliah terasa recehan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pound sedang naik, tuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kak Kurumi bodoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.21,0:08:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau aku enggak tunggu,\Ncuanku pasti sudah lumayan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:50.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya aku sudah bisa\Nbertarung seorang diri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan melampaui\NKak Kurumi dengan mudah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:01.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hajar 100 lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.23,0:09:03.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eksekusi posisi beli!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada transaksi ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}leverage yang dipakai Mebuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.91,0:09:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah sekitar 246 kali.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Uang kuliah
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.91,0:09:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan kudapatkan dengan cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika terjadi sesuatu,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.92,0:09:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tanpa sempat berpikir sedikit pun,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:21.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tewaslah dia seketika.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naiklah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.76,0:09:36.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naiklah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.41,0:09:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyebab pergerakan harga\Nyang tajam ini
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.32,0:09:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah pengumuman indikator ekonomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.61,0:09:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Indikator ekonomi adalah
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.07,0:09:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}data yang dirilis secara berkala
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.19,0:10:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}oleh berbagai negara terkait ekonomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.93,0:10:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Isinya
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}langsung berdampak pada pasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.68,0:10:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terkadang, pasar yang tadinya stabil
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.13,0:10:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dapat hancur dalam sekejap mata.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.05,0:10:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata bayar uang kuliah\Ngampang sekali!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.60,0:10:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki bisa merasakan mimpi indah ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:34.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}hanya berlangsung puluhan detik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:57.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}B-Begitu, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.05,0:10:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika pasar segejolak ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:01.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kembalinya juga pasti cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.60,0:11:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untung berjalan 500 ribu yen...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.20,0:11:05.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, ambil untung\Ndi 200 ribu yen saja...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.65,0:11:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebentar... pergerakan apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.96,0:11:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Indikator?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Carney?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.52,0:11:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong bicara dengan bahasa\Nyang gampang buatku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tahu, kasih tahu aku, dong...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.32,0:11:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa-apaan pernyataan pejabat itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:11:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pernyataan oleh pejabat dunia
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:12:01.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mengenai ekonomi dan kurs valas
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seperti indikator ekonomi,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terkadang memberikan\Ndampak besar pada pasar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi siapa tahu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}harganya malah melonjak naik!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.88,0:12:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dan Pound sangat cocok,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Carney pasti menolongku!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.85,0:12:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Carney datang menolongku!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.87,0:12:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Carney.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.85,0:12:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada hari ini,\NGubernur Bank Sentral Inggris
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.08,0:12:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menyampaikan pandangan negatif\Nterkait kenaikan suku bunga,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mempercepat penjualan Pound\Noleh para investor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.29,0:12:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.83,0:13:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau kerugian berjalan\Nmelebihi saldo milikku?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.09,0:13:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan utang?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.69,0:13:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahaya! Utang itu bahaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus bilang apa pada ibu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong hamba, ya Tuhan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:12.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamatkan hamba!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.10,0:13:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hamba enggak akan serakah lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Halo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.68,0:13:31.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gimana di kampung?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.27,0:13:34.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, begitulah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.08,0:13:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa? Kok enggak semangat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu rugi main Forex?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedikit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.43,0:13:44.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jumlahnya enggak seberapa, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kayaknya sekitar 100 ribu yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu rugi besar, dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lebih baik berhenti selagi masih menang,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebelum kamu tewas sekali hajar\Nkarena mengincar untung besar di Pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.01,0:13:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai jumpa lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku malah berbohong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau bilang rugi besar,\Ndia pasti bakal khawatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.29,0:14:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.92,0:14:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini cuma modal 200 ribu yen yang hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau cuma segini...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}asalkan pakai sisa uang beasiswa...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahun ini kamu enggak pulang kampung lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga enggak hadir\Nupacara kedewasaan, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.59,0:14:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biarin aja, lah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.23,0:14:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Buat apa datang ke perkumpulan\Norang-orang pamer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu aneh banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.36,0:15:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal kalau kamu pakai kimono,\Norang tuamu pasti senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.97,0:15:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak peduli sama orang tua.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.60,0:15:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mending kamu coba lihat ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}EUR/USD gila banget, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau pegang posisi jual,\Npasti cuan besar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski begitu, belakangan ini\Nkamu menang beruntun, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.19,0:15:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mencapai target 20 juta yen\Njadi terasa gampang, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, enggak juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena juga ada pertimbangan pajak,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}target asliku itu 25 juta yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.72,0:15:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih jauh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:33.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berarti kamu harus pakai\Nleverage tinggi, dong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:35.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, rencananya begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, gitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kamu incar mata uang apa sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:43.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin USD/JPY kayak biasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malahan, aku sudah beli\Nwaktu jam kuliah tadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kecanduan, tuh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.16,0:15:51.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya EUR/USD sedang mati,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.85,0:15:53.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan USD/JPY kelihatannya naik...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naik lumayan tinggi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya aku beli lebih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh iya,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apa belakangan ini\NMebuki menghubungimu?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.08,0:16:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah... belum kontak lagi sejak libur Obon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin sedang menikmati waktu di kampung.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.76,0:16:25.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak akan gagal\Nuntuk kedua kalinya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.89,0:16:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Modal perangku kali ini
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.25,0:16:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah 600 ribu yen tabungan kuliah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bayarannya musim semi depan,\Njadi enggak masalah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.47,0:16:36.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Target pertamaku adalah
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.05,0:16:39.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}merebut kembali modal 200 ribu yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.64,0:16:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu dapat untung di atas\N200 ribu yen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.84,0:16:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}langsung tarik modal dan kembalikan\N600 ribu yen ke tabungan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan medan perang berikutnya adalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku yang sudah bertarung memakai Pound,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}enggak mungkin kalah\Ndari mata uang keroco ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.67,0:17:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yasuko, kamu enggak perlu khawatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Operasi merebut kembali 200 ribu yen\Ndimulai sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau melihat USD/JPY sekarang,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.61,0:17:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}siapa pun pasti berpikir begini:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}105 yen itu harga tertinggi tahun ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.73,0:17:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti enggak akan melewati angka ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak mungkin naik di sini...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.20,0:17:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena semua berpikir begitu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.65,0:17:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tentu saja pesanan jual membludak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga harus jual sebelum turun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.64,0:17:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Lalu, aksi jual memicu aksi jual lagi...\N- Biarkan aku jual! Jual!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan bakal turun drastis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.67,0:17:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Angka 100 yen bukan sekadar mimpi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski enggak sampai sejauh itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.52,0:17:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kalau turun 2 yen,\Ncuannya 200 ribu yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Target tercapai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cara berpikir orang genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Logika sempurna!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.71,0:17:49.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:52.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}malah naik hampir 1 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:17:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki! Lagi apa kamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu mau pulang hari ini, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pa-Paling naiknya cuma sementara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.43,0:18:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Percayalah pada logika sempurna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak ada yang kelupaan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.41,0:18:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.72,0:18:16.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wajahmu pucat, loh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.07,0:18:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki, kamu enggak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.39,0:18:19.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada masalah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.91,0:18:22.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak, aku biasa saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:23.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berangkat dulu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.24,0:18:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Makan yang benar dan semangat, ya!\N- Sampai jumpa lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.95,0:18:32.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah itu USD/JPY terus melonjak
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan harga penutupan akhir pekan\Nmencetak angka 107 yen per dolar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.79,0:18:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat turun, dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.16,0:18:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya sudahlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:53.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang acara besar yang kutunggu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}indikator ekonomi "FOMC"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:19:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini akan memicu kejatuhan harga
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.33,0:19:03.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan semua pemegang posisi beli\Nbakal putus asa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.92,0:19:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gyaaaaaaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kumohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.80,0:19:20.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Turun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.97,0:19:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.59,0:19:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang saatnya kejatuhan dahsyat...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku marah sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:01.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tambah jual lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tembak 10 lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.39,0:20:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana dengan ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudahlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.93,0:20:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau tidur!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku enggak mau lihat grafik lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.69,0:20:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}USD/JPY bagaimana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.11,0:20:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena tadi menambah posisi\Njual 10 lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.49,0:21:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku hanya bisa bertahan sampai 109,6 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:03.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sisa nyawaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:13.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tinggal 1,5 yen lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau naik 1,5 yen lagi,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.63,0:21:17.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}uang kuliahku akan ludes tanpa sisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.93,0:21:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pasti bakal dimarahi\Nhabis-habisan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.79,0:21:27.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal sekarang saja\Nsudah bikin khawatir...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makan yang benar dan semangat, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:37.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa jadi begini?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus rebut kembali...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.92,0:23:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mebuki! Kamu tahu, enggak?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.59,0:23:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Grafik lilin itu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.55,0:23:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dinamai begitu karena bentuknya\Nmirip lilin, loh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.38,0:23:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.73,0:23:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.96,0:23:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Woi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.80,0:23:33.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nyala lilin kehidupanmu\Nsudah mau padam, tuh!
